# Figure authoring, deliberately not part of the sample.
# The three diagrams ship as PNGs under images/ and nothing else. Their HTML sources
# live outside this repo and the render script only exists to turn those sources into
# those PNGs, so shipping either would give a reader a script that references files
# they do not have. Regenerate figures from the authoring directory, not from a clone.
architecture*.html
scripts/render_figures.sh
